# Allowlist: credentials, host virtualenv, runtime records and .git stay outside.
**
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
!src/**
!samples/
!samples/**
!scripts/
!scripts/container_healthcheck.py
!scripts/inspect_dlq.py
# Even a misplaced credential inside an allowed folder must stay out.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.secrets/**
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.py[cod]
